  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Pillar represents culture and sophistication, and the elevation thereof. It does not necessarily mean one type or idea of culture is greater than the other, but the best of those qualities and its refinement is meant to be raised and shined through. Even though, that usually comes with pride and prejudice. The Pillar's Eye highlights the unerring gaze of someone at the top, who sees more than their peers.</p><p><strong>Constellation </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.deities.P43Qt6g6aRdxi0gp]{The Pillar}</p><hr><p><strong>First Asterism</strong> (Level 8) You gain the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.feats.B3ckH8S7IlBn73pq]{Black Dragon Smoke} constellation feat.</p>"
